@WebApplication1_HostAddress = http://localhost:5062

### Register a new user
POST {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/Users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123"
}

### Get user by ID (replace `1` with the actual user ID you get from registration response)
GET {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/Users/1
Accept: application/json

### Upload Bid Document (replace BID_GUID with a real Bid ID)
POST {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/BidDocuments/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bidId": "BID_GUID",
  "name": "Technical Proposal",
  "description": "Technical documentation for the bid.",
  "filePath": "/documents/tech-proposal.pdf",
  "fileSize": 204800,
  "contentType": "application/pdf",
  "documentType": 0
}

### Get Documents by Bid ID (replace BID_GUID with the same Bid ID)
GET {{WebApplication1_HostAddress}}/api/BidDocuments/bid/BID_GUID
Accept: application/json
